00:30:14.100 --> 00:30:14.860
Just kidding.

619
00:30:15.100 --> 00:30:15.580
Just kidding.

620
00:30:17.520 --> 00:30:19.420
He'll get him the best iced tea in the world.

621
00:30:19.520 --> 00:30:19.760
Yeah.

622
00:30:19.760 --> 00:30:22.680
First of all, Rob Hubel is back as AJ.

623
00:30:22.960 --> 00:30:23.240
Uh-huh.

624
00:30:23.240 --> 00:30:24.540
And he's so good.

625
00:30:24.660 --> 00:30:27.300
He's being so nice to Michael.

626
00:30:27.300 --> 00:30:27.860
I know.

627
00:30:28.000 --> 00:30:28.640
And you're like-

628
00:30:28.640 --> 00:30:30.660
The whole episode, and you're like, oh, my gosh.

629
00:30:30.700 --> 00:30:34.880
This guy must really love Holly to be that patient with Michael.

630
00:30:35.120 --> 00:30:38.800
I want to point out in this scene that Kevin is having a beer.

631
00:30:39.320 --> 00:30:39.700
Yes.

632
00:30:39.900 --> 00:30:41.360
Holly asks for a lemonade.

633
00:30:42.140 --> 00:30:43.500
AJ wants an iced tea.

634
00:30:43.880 --> 00:30:48.840
According to a big banner in the background, you can really see it over Michael's shoulder

