00:31:08.540 --> 00:31:09.680
Stanley drinks one of those.

644
00:31:09.980 --> 00:31:10.480
Hurricane.

645
00:31:10.860 --> 00:31:11.680
Oh, wow.

646
00:31:12.200 --> 00:31:13.400
Tequila sunrise.

647
00:31:13.680 --> 00:31:14.100
Dang.

648
00:31:14.480 --> 00:31:18.020
Beer, wine, sodas, water.

649
00:31:18.400 --> 00:31:19.380
No iced tea.

650
00:31:19.700 --> 00:31:20.140
No iced tea.

651
00:31:20.140 --> 00:31:20.680
No lemonade.

652
00:31:22.340 --> 00:31:24.060
Lots of booze.

653
00:31:24.060 --> 00:31:25.320
Lots of booze.

