Soulmates is what you aim for, but soup snakes is what you get sometimes.

681
00:32:41.880 --> 00:32:42.360
Aww.

682
00:32:42.700 --> 00:32:44.160
Is that so sweet?

683
00:32:44.460 --> 00:32:44.760
Yeah.

684
00:32:45.280 --> 00:32:46.280
They are soup snakes.

685
00:32:46.380 --> 00:32:47.500
They are soup snakes.

