695
00:33:19.820 --> 00:33:20.520
Oh, really?

696
00:33:20.720 --> 00:33:23.300
Yes, because Charles was always mean to Jim.

697
00:33:23.300 --> 00:33:29.380
But I have to say, lady, he is not wrong on his read of Jim.

698
00:33:30.120 --> 00:33:33.520
Like, Jim is very charming, but he, I mean-

