751
00:35:28.640 --> 00:35:30.700
What is up with this plot inconsistency?

752
00:35:30.940 --> 00:35:33.780
Now, we did discuss this when we broke down job fair.

753
00:35:34.000 --> 00:35:35.040
You had your theory.

