00:35:35.040 --> 00:35:40.720
Yes, there was a fan theory that Pam wanted out of the non-competitive gym class volleyball.

755
00:35:40.980 --> 00:35:42.680
This is a very kind theory.

756
00:35:43.280 --> 00:35:48.440
This is like, I mean, this is a very kind, kind, like, let's just make any excuse.

757
00:35:49.000 --> 00:35:54.500
Well, Jen Salata did an interview for Office Tally, and she admitted they just forgot about

758
00:35:54.500 --> 00:35:55.740
that line when they wrote this.

759
00:35:55.780 --> 00:35:56.840
Of course they did.

760
00:35:57.540 --> 00:36:01.700
They didn't strategically plot out, like, you know what, Pam was so competitive.

761
00:36:02.040 --> 00:36:03.620
She didn't want to do P.E.

762
00:36:03.780 --> 00:36:04.220
volleyball.

763
00:36:04.480 --> 00:36:04.720
Right.

764
00:36:04.720 --> 00:36:06.300
I still like that theory.

765
00:36:06.580 --> 00:36:07.220
I know, I know.

766
00:36:07.400 --> 00:36:08.920
Pam continues to dominate.

767
00:36:09.120 --> 00:36:14.600
She wins the game for her team, advances them to the next round, because I am just that good.

768
00:36:14.740 --> 00:36:15.180
Yeah.

769
00:36:15.460 --> 00:36:17.940
Well, I have a kid catch.

770
00:36:18.300 --> 00:36:19.720
