857
00:39:31.320 --> 00:39:35.320
in the Office Lady Pod stories, and he sent me her resume.

858
00:39:35.760 --> 00:39:38.780
On her resume, it shows her height and her weight,

859
00:39:38.900 --> 00:39:42.540
