860
00:39:42.920 --> 00:39:46.240
Oh, because they matched her height and weight to you?

861
00:39:46.240 --> 00:39:48.360
Yes, when they find you a body double or a stunt double,

862
00:39:48.520 --> 00:39:50.560
they have to match the person's height, the weight,

863
00:39:50.760 --> 00:39:53.520
the general hair color, or they'll put a wig on the person

864
00:39:53.520 --> 00:39:54.940
or color that person's hair.

865
00:39:55.100 --> 00:39:58.340
But it's more than that because I was on this one movie,

866
00:39:58.360 --> 00:40:00.040
and they had to get a body double for me.

867
00:40:00.520 --> 00:40:03.200
And the woman showed up, and she was my height and weight,

868
00:40:03.240 --> 00:40:05.320
but her, like, weight distribution

869
00:40:05.320 --> 00:40:07.180
was totally different from mine.

870
00:40:07.520 --> 00:40:08.780
So walking and...

871
00:40:08.780 --> 00:40:09.700
She didn't look like me.

872
00:40:09.760 --> 00:40:10.380
She didn't look like you.

873
00:40:10.520 --> 00:40:11.600
This happened to me, Jenna.

874
00:40:16.240 --> 00:40:19.900
Dolly scene that started in a room and ended up on the sofa

875
00:40:19.900 --> 00:40:21.100
that I was sitting on.

876
00:40:21.180 --> 00:40:21.380
Okay.

877
00:40:22.020 --> 00:40:26.700
And they had a body double for me for all the lighting set up

878
00:40:26.700 --> 00:40:28.700
because it was going to take a really long time

879
00:40:28.700 --> 00:40:30.280
to get this set up.

880
00:40:31.280 --> 00:40:33.880
So after an hour of them setting this all up,

881
00:40:34.200 --> 00:40:37.420
using the body double, it's time for me to report on set.

882
00:40:37.560 --> 00:40:40.320
We do this long, intricate tracking shot.

883
00:40:40.420 --> 00:40:42.640
The camera's coming down this long track,

884
00:40:42.860 --> 00:40:44.660
lands on me on the sofa,

885
00:40:44.660 --> 00:40:46.420
and it cuts part of my head off.

886
00:40:46.740 --> 00:40:49.680
Well, what they found out was she was my exact height.

887
00:40:49.880 --> 00:40:51.180
They immediately called for her

888
00:40:51.180 --> 00:40:52.400
because the director of photography

889
00:40:52.400 --> 00:40:54.880
had set up all this time for the shot.

890
00:40:55.040 --> 00:40:56.540
And he said, are you 5'1"?

891
00:40:56.540 --> 00:40:57.280
And she said, yes.

892
00:40:57.340 --> 00:40:58.640
And she came and stood next to me.

893
00:40:58.760 --> 00:40:59.800
We were the same height.

894
00:40:59.980 --> 00:41:01.900
And then he said, sit side by side.

895
00:41:02.180 --> 00:41:03.540
We sat side by side.

896
00:41:03.880 --> 00:41:05.780
I had a longer torso than she did.

897
00:41:06.080 --> 00:41:06.480
Yes!

898
00:41:06.860 --> 00:41:08.140
This is what I'm saying.

899
00:41:08.580 --> 00:41:10.700
So they had to, like, measure her.

900
00:41:10.840 --> 00:41:12.420
Like, did we have the same waist?

901
00:41:12.420 --> 00:41:14.920
The circumference of your thigh.

902
00:41:15.240 --> 00:41:16.300
Like, all of that.

903
00:41:16.480 --> 00:41:20.740
And Nancy McCrum was just an exact body double for me.

904
00:41:20.900 --> 00:41:23.620
Well, I could never tell that there was a body double there,

905
00:41:23.640 --> 00:41:24.900
so they did a great job.

906
00:41:25.040 --> 00:41:26.320
Well, here's what I did.

907
00:41:26.400 --> 00:41:28.740
She was also very good at volleyball,

908
00:41:29.540 --> 00:41:32.160
and she taught me how to do the motion,

909
00:41:32.380 --> 00:41:34.720
how to jump up, how to serve it, and all of that.

910
00:41:34.860 --> 00:41:37.740
And I did a whole, whole bunch of takes,

911
00:41:37.740 --> 00:41:40.260
