He is still working with Steve.

960
00:43:32.680 --> 00:43:35.280
It's been like 16 years they've been working together.

961
00:43:35.840 --> 00:43:37.980
They're working together on a movie right now.

962
00:43:38.140 --> 00:43:38.820
Look at that!

963
00:43:39.000 --> 00:43:40.140
Oh my gosh!

964
00:43:40.380 --> 00:43:41.960
Yes, I remember him!

965
00:43:42.080 --> 00:43:43.740
I know, he was so lovely.

966
00:43:43.940 --> 00:43:45.400
And I said, Eric, it's so crazy

967
00:43:45.400 --> 00:43:46.920
to see you outside of a suit

968
00:43:46.920 --> 00:43:48.800
because he was just in casual clothes.

969
00:43:48.940 --> 00:43:49.120
Yeah.

970
00:43:49.540 --> 00:43:53.020
But sometimes when Steve needed out for, you know,

971
00:43:53.220 --> 00:43:55.260
something they had to get him to a talk show or whatever,

972
00:43:55.860 --> 00:43:57.860
Eric in a suit would sit in the office there

973
00:43:57.860 --> 00:43:59.940
