974
00:44:00.220 --> 00:44:02.820
You could catch his shoulder or the side of him.

975
00:44:02.980 --> 00:44:05.860
And they are still working together now, 16 years.

976
00:44:06.140 --> 00:44:06.960
I love that.

977
00:44:07.080 --> 00:44:07.540
Me too!

978
00:44:07.980 --> 00:44:10.140
Well, listen, ladies, should we take a little break?

