I know there was one point where I said, let's just, I think Scranton was playing Nashua, maybe Utica.

1273
00:56:02.330 --> 00:56:03.770
And I just said, well, let's just play for a while.

1274
00:56:03.910 --> 00:56:05.630
Let's just play some volleyball as we get warmed up.

1275
00:56:05.850 --> 00:56:07.970
And Utica killed us.

1276
