1797
01:16:52.380 --> 01:16:53.260
Wow, what a great note.

1798
01:16:53.680 --> 01:16:54.320
Is that cool?

1799
01:16:54.540 --> 01:16:56.080
Yeah, that told me.

1800
01:16:56.340 --> 01:16:57.140
This look.

