1816
01:17:41.980 --> 01:17:45.320
That's great directing by Ken Kwapis and a great performance by John.

1817
01:17:45.500 --> 01:17:46.320
And you too.

1818
01:17:46.800 --> 01:17:47.220
Aw.

1819
01:17:47.580 --> 01:17:48.840
I loved this moment.

1820
01:17:48.980 --> 01:17:50.320
