And then every day, you guys, they would send NBC the CDs of the dailies.

1857
01:19:31.820 --> 01:19:33.240
Of what we had shot that day.

1858
01:19:33.380 --> 01:19:33.900
That's right.

1859
01:19:33.940 --> 01:19:35.780
It was deleted from that.

1860
01:19:36.160 --> 01:19:36.680
Oh my gosh.

1861
01:19:36.680 --> 01:19:43.200
